ROLE OF THE COMMUNITY
Article 25 (1) In implementing the Protection of Women, the community may: a. establish family partners at the kelurahan / village level;
b. establish women's protection units within community organizations;
c. conduct independent socialization of Women's rights;
d. provide first aid to Women Victims of Violence;
e. report to the competent authority if violence against Women occurs in their environment;
